# Updater signing keys. These live in ~/.tauri and belong in GitHub Actions
# secrets, never in the repository. A private key committed here would let
# anyone sign an update that installs itself on every student's machine, and
# git history would keep it after the delete. Belt and braces: the real keys
# are already outside the tree.
*.key
*.key.pub
*updater*.password
.vite/
app/shots/
app/src-tauri/gen/schemas/
NEXT_SESSION.md

# Android release signing. The key and its passwords are the app's identity -
# change them later and every user must uninstall and lose their data - so they
# live on the machine that does releases and nowhere else. See
# docs/ANDROID-SIGNING.md.
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

# Brainstorming visual companion (local session scratch)
.superpowers/brainstorm/
